  <a href="#act" class="stage border-orange no-underline"><b class="text-orange">Act</b><span>executes the plan, writing code and running checks. Or task by task: <b class="file">/split-plan-tasks</b>, then <b class="file">/execute-plan-tasks</b></span></a>
  <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
  <a href="#consolidate" class="stage border-purple no-underline"><b class="text-purple">Consolidate</b><span>stabilizes the work: review it with fresh eyes using <b class="file">/self-review</b>, then hand over the knowledge in <b class="file">HANDOVER.md</b></span></a>
